<title>USA: Uniroyal buys C Gunther.</title>
<headline>Uniroyal buys C Gunther.</headline>
<dateline>SARASOTA, Fla. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniroyal Technology Corp said on Monday that it bought the stock of the C. Gunther Co for a combination of cash and Uniroyal stock.  The terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Uniroyal President and Chief Operating Officer Robert Soran said, &quot;This new business will complement our Silaprene line of adhesives and sealants.  Gunther's gross margins are very good and this acquisition will increase our industrial business by approximately 50 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>Uniroyal Technology manufactures and sells proprietary plastic products and specialty chemical and polymer products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
